error: an inferred type cannot declare an array: `array`
  --> sema-auto-type-clang.c:12:17
   |
12 |     __auto_type array[2] = {1, 2};
   |                 ^^^^^^^^ array declarator
   |
   = note: C23 §6.7.10p2: a declarator other than an identifier is implementation-defined; Clang deduces through pointer and function declarators but not an array

